This pack adapts or seeds material from two MIT-licensed upstreams. Both notices are
reproduced below, as the MIT terms require and as the `upstreams.toml` register
entries `[i-have-adhd]` and `[asd-ste100-skill]` record.

===============================================================================
1. ayghri/i-have-adhd — the SHAPE layer of skills/attention-control
   https://github.com/ayghri/i-have-adhd
===============================================================================

Lead with the next action, number multi-step work, restate state every turn, cap
lists, no preamble or closer. The text here is rewritten for this repository's
conventions rather than copied; the notice is retained because the adaptation is
substantial.

