===============================================================================
2. danyuchn/asd-ste100-skill — the seed of skills/asd-ste100, base 7d4a135
   https://github.com/danyuchn/asd-ste100-skill
===============================================================================

Seeded under MIT, then adapted into own work: the skill does not track that repo,
has no update path, and syncs only through the Pack system. Deltas are recorded in
`skills/asd-ste100/` and in the register entry. This notice moved here whole when the
former `asd-ste100` Pack was merged into this one on 2026-09-17; it is the same text
that Pack's own LICENSE carried, so nothing was dropped.

Note the standard is NOT reproduced. ASD-STE100 is free to obtain but not free to
redistribute, so `references/writing-rules.md` states the rule categories and cites
the standard rather than copying its ~900-word approved dictionary. See the skill's
"Source and Scope".

